# The build context is the repository (or, on a server, an exported release of it). Only what the
# Dockerfiles copy matters; everything else is excluded so that no local data or secret can end up in an
# image by accident.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
var
agent
docs
infra
deploy/test
**/test-results
